        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When you focus your magic on an ally, you can remove harmful conditions.</p>\n<p>If your next action is to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Cast a Spell] from a spell slot, and that spell targets only a single ally, you can also attempt to remove a harmful condition from that ally. The condition must be one that could be removed by your Mercy feat, including those granted by later feats such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Greater Mercy].</p>\n<p>Attempt a counteract check based on the spell's DC and level. This effect is in addition to the normal effects of your spell.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "PT10M"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
